  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 301.16 Additional Permit Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 301.16 Additional Permit Conditions. If additional conditions or effluent limitations are necessary to ensure that the discharge does not violate Env-Wq 1700, the department shall include such conditions or effluent limitations in the permit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 301) #10348, eff 5-22-13; ss by #13613, eff 5-22-23",
